# Secrets / local env
.env

# Node
# No trailing slash: a trailing slash matches only DIRECTORIES, and the pattern
# CLAUDE.md recommends for throwaway worktrees is a SYMLINK to a long-lived
# worktree's node_modules (it avoids `npm ci`, which clobbers the host's
# agent-browser). That symlink was unignored and one `git add -A` from being
# committed. Bare path matches file, dir and symlink alike.
web/node_modules
agent/node_modules
node_modules
web/dist/

